.PP
Retrieves the bit at the specified logical index within the span's view\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIindex\fP The zero-based index inside the view window\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
\fRtrue\fP if the bit is set; otherwise \fRfalse\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBExceptions\fP
.RS 4
\fIArgumentOutOfRangeException\fP Thrown when \fIindex\fP  exceeds the view length\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP
The returned bit depends on the active \fBFlexSpanMode\fP: 
.PD 0
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBSystem\fP: direct forward mapping\&. 
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBReverse\fP: mirrored mapping from the end\&. 
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBRing\fP: index wraps modulo the view length\&. 
.PP

